    "description": "Natural History Collection\nRock & Mineral Specimen Lot\nNatural Geological Specimens, Quartz, Geodes & Minerals\n12\" x 8.75\" x 7\" Overall Box Size\nUnsigned\nThis comprehensive geological collection features an assortment of natural mineral specimens, crystal formations, and polished stones weighing approximately 13.4 pounds in total. The lot includes a boxed educational mineral study set with individual compartmented specimens, hollow quartz geode halves with crystalline cavities, a carved geometric solid stone display piece, natural crystal clusters, a pyrite specimen, and multiple bags and containers of rough and tumbled gemstones including amethyst, clear quartz, tourmaline, and jasper.\nFeatures a diverse variety of geological specimens including quartz geodes, pyrite, and crystal clusters\nIncludes compartmentalized collection tray with numbered individual specimen compartments\nAccompanied by polished geometric carving and assortment of rough and tumbled mineral stones\nOnly includes what is shown in pictures, any accessories or items not shown but described cannot be guaranteed to be included with the lot.\nCondition:\nVery good overall condition across the specimen collection. Natural crystal formations exhibit typical organic inclusions, textures, and fracture surfaces inherent to geologic specimens. Storage containers, bags, and boxed compartment tray show light handling and storage wear consistent with age and use.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said